  <Docs>
    <summary>Records GPU drawing commands for a Graphite context and captures them into a <see cref="T:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteRecording" />.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <format type="text/markdown"><![CDATA[
## Remarks

A recorder is created from a <xref:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteContext> and is used to
build up GPU work. Call <xref:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteRecorder.Snap> to capture the
recorded commands into a recording, then insert that recording into the context
for execution. This type wraps a native Skia resource and must be disposed when
no longer needed.
]]></format>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
